<title>AUSTRALIA: Lang to acquires rest of Jamieson.</title>
<headline>Lang to acquires rest of Jamieson.</headline>
<text>
<p>SYDNEY, Oct 4 (Reuter) _ Lang Corp said on Friday it planned to acquire the remaining stake in investment group Jamieson Equity that it did not already own for A$53.5 million cash and the issue of 27.4 million Lang shares.</p>
</text>
